//! 0. `program` — readonly, pinned `whirLbMiicVdio4qvUfM5KAg6Ct8VwpYzGff3uctyCc`
//! 1. `token_program_a` — readonly
//! 2. `token_program_b` — readonly
//! 3. `memo_program` — readonly, pinned `MemoSq4gqABAXKb96qnH8TysNcWxMyWCqXgDLGmfcHr`
//! 4. `token_authority` — signer
//! 5. `whirlpool` — writable
//! 6. `mint_a` — readonly
